# Client-facing reports generated into the repo root.
# Vercel serves this repo's ROOT as the static site (vercel.json sets no
# outputDirectory and there is no build step), so ANY file committed here is
# published at https://regenorthopb.com/<filename> with no auth. Performance
# reports are for the practice, not for the public web — keep them untracked
# and deliver them out of band.
RegenOrtho-Performance-Report-*.pdf
